            "answer": "<p>Florida's Residential Swimming Pool Safety Act wants the barrier at least 48 inches high on the outside. The gate must close on its own and open away from the pool. Our gate hinges, latch and floor lock are made for 12 mm tempered glass gates, in the same 2205 stainless as the spigots. The City of Boca Raton building division confirms the barrier details at permit time.</p>",
